WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.628 --> 00:00:05.891
Check the request that will go out,

2
00:00:05.891 --> 00:00:08.813
then predict the result.

3
00:00:08.813 --> 00:00:13.685
You can send once you pick a prediction.

4
00:00:13.685 --> 00:00:16.741
The same request reaches the five approaches at once:

5
00:00:16.741 --> 00:00:18.471
firewall, sign-in, fixed rule,

6
00:00:18.471 --> 00:00:20.432
approval-record rule, and Contexa.

7
00:00:20.432 --> 00:00:24.038
Contexa holds the response while it decides;

8
00:00:24.038 --> 00:00:26.087
nothing leaves meanwhile.

9
00:00:26.087 --> 00:00:27.152
On the right,

10
00:00:27.152 --> 00:00:30.840
the facts it checks against the usual pattern

11
00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:34.446
and the company records light up one by one.

12
00:00:34.446 --> 00:00:39.115
Each bar is the data a kind of security

13
00:00:39.115 --> 00:00:41.629
actually handed over.

14
00:00:41.629 --> 00:00:47.614
A red bar leaked; an empty bar means nothing left.

15
00:00:47.614 --> 00:00:51.784
The log below keeps each step

16
00:00:51.784 --> 00:00:58.254
with its real time since the request arrived.

17
00:00:58.254 --> 00:01:02.112
Contexa's judgment is one of allowed,

18
00:01:02.112 --> 00:01:04.510
extra check or blocked.

19
00:01:04.510 --> 00:01:08.264
Send it yourself to see this result.
